      "id": "story_2361_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "ある男が非常に好みの新しい靴を一足買いました。",
      "text_en": "A man bought a new pair of shoes that he liked very much, so he wore them on the train to visit his girlfriend.",
