\" data-defn=\"direct object marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">を</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"はき\" data-defn=\"to put on (lower-body clothing, e.g. pants, skirt, footwear)/to wear; to affix (a swo (履く)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">履き</span><rt>はき</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ました\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (past: did / -ed)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ました</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
